# A set whose shapes lie further apart than the 64 bits of an immediate is tested with a bit set. A type in an operation's payload names this one, so the table of shape sets has its words
# FORM: AsRead
# OPTIONS: only-passes=ResolveAccesses,PlaceTypeTests
# RUN: place shapes
# RUN(TABLES): tables

